<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JUD" style="id">Ibeembe Congo</book>
  <para style="h">YUUDE</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yud</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukaanda a Yuude</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuude</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukaanda a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yuude</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="imi">
    <char style="em">Mukaanda a Yuude</char> ni mukaanda wu batsinduu kwaa baata boosi bali mu libuundu la Kristo. Mamasonomo mu mukaanda wuunawu, mafwaanina na mili mu mukaanda wa mioolo wa Peetero (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2PE 2">2Pe 2</ref></char>). Mikaanda mio miamioolo mili mu udwaanisa miyiisi mia pia mili mu uha nziisili yimbi, we buli beelili a bo ya tsionyi.</para>
  <para style="imi">Mu kotili a mukaanda (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:1-2">1-2</ref></char>) Yude li mu utungululu miyiisi mia pia, mimaakoto mu libuundu. Na nde li mu uyaabisa tsieembili a Nziaambi yikaabwiilili bo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:3-16">3-16</ref></char>). Mu ndaa yii, libuundu lafwaana mu umene miaanzi mu Nziaambi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:17-23">17-23</ref></char>). Ku manini a mukaanda, bali mu udumusu na uha mbilili kwaa Nziaambi: «Ni nde ayobili bisi bu atsinduu Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo» (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:24-25">24—25</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="imi">Mukaanda wuunawu li mu utungululu litu la pia na nziisili yimbi. Nde li mu ulaa libaasila na ilimbisi kili na bangaa imiini mu Nziaambi, mu Yiisu Kristo na mu Muheebili wa Ngira (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JUD 1:20-21">20—21</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Me ni Yuda, wuli musiali a Yiisu Kristo, mwaana a nguu a Yaakobi. Me sonii mukaanda wu, kwaa baata ba Taata Nziaambi ateeri mbili, ba nde makulu atoono, na li mu ukebe bo mu ndaa a Yiisu Kristo.<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Nyaala bweese, iyeenge na litoono la Nziaambi, biba kwaa beni kwalaa!<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Miyiisi mia pia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Banduu ba me ba litoono, me mbeeri na nzala ya laa, mu usonuu beni mukaanda, mundaa yatala buni Nziaambi ayobili bisi. Ka, me moni ti, too me sonuu beni mukaanda wu mu taanga di, paa me hamisa beni mu udwaana mundaa imiini. Ni imiini ki Nziaambi aheeri mbala mosi kwa ikulu, kwaa babali baata ba ngira. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Ni mubuu, me nisonuu kwaa beni, paa disa mayele, mundaa ti uli na baata babamosi bangaa matsimi mamabi, bamaakoto nha kati a beni mu tsweeyi. Bo bangooyi bali mu ubalila ndaa ya bweese la Nziaambi a bisi, paa babaa buungu mu biyiluu bia tsoongili. Na bo bali mu ubisi Yiisu Kristo, wuli Muyiisi na Pfumu a bisi ndila mosi. Umatuu bele pe, Mabasonuu ma ngira, mayaabisi tsieembili yili nha yulu a bo.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Kwaa beni ba diayaaba mandaa, me tooni ulibili beni moonyo ti, Pfumu a bisi akuuli baata ba Iseraeli, mu tsi ya Ngipiti, nde abwifuusu bababisi usa nde imiini. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Dilibili moonyi ka mu batumu ba Nziaambi, babahele ukebe iteesi kia litu la bo, li bali na lo. Ka bo babwoongili mbuu yi Nziaambi ali ataasili bo. Nziaambi wabakuti bibolo bia bitali mu bilimi na bilimi, wabadumini ku tsini ku li pimisi, natee mu iluumbu ki inene kia pfuundisi. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Dilibili moonyi mu baata ba ngaanda a Sodomo, na ba Ngomoro, na mangaanda mamadiengelele. Baata ba mangaanda ma, bayeelili manyutu ma bo mu ipuupu, weti bwasiiri batumu ba. Bo basiayi uvuutu manyutu ma bo na batumu ba Nziaambi. Mu taanga di, bo bali mu umono pasi kutso mbaa ya bilimi na bilimi. Yi ni ndimbili a moonyi kwaa baata boosi.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Ee, baata baa-na-ba, bali mu uyiluu ka bumosi. Monini a bo ya pia yili mu ubiti bo mu usumunu manyutu ma bo. Bo bali mu umeengele litu la Nziaambi, na bali mu utuu biyiluu bia buzitu bili mu mayula. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />So, Mikayeli mukuutu a batumu ba Nziaambi, a ayilii buu pe! Nde bu ali kutso mudiingi a nde na Saatina, bu bakidwaanina nyutu a Mooso, Mikayeli a ayesini pe upfuundisi na utuu Saatina. Ka nde aleeli ndila bu: «Nyaala Pfumu asieembe we!» <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Ka baata ba, bali mu utuu biyiluu bia moonyi bi bo bahele uyaaba. Bo bali mu uyiluu mandaa kutso bundimbi, weti banyama. Ni mu buu, mandaa maa, ni mali mu ubiti bo ku pfuuyili.<verse eid="JUD 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Ngebe kwaa bo! Mundaa ti bo baduki kuulu a Kayini. Bo batakii na kuulu ya ngwanya, na bo bayalii manyutu ma bo mu ndaa nzala a mboongo, weti bwasiiri mubili Balaami. Bo baholi tsieembili mundaa ti bo babisi utumumu Nziaambi, weti bwasiiri Koore. <verse eid="JUD 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Mu taanga di beni dili mu uvuutunu mu udia mu litoono, miyiisi mia pia mili nha, mili mu ubiisi mikuungi mia beni. Bo bali mu uyuluu mandaa kwahele a tsionyi, na bali mu utsimi mu ndila bomo a kulu. Bo bali weti matuti mapiindi ma mupepe ali mu ukuungulu kwa hele a mvulu unooso. Bo bafwaanina ka na miti mili mu uhele ubutu mbutu, so mu taanga di miti mibaabutu. Bu butaapali miti me, mio mimaakwa mbala ya dioolo. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Bo bafwaanina na mapoo ma mubu ma mifuri. Bo bali mu udumunu biyiluu bia bo bia tsionyi, weti bu mubu ali mu udumunu mafuri ku simi. Bo bafwaanina na bambwelele bali mu uyene mayene-ayene. Nziaambi aswehele bo mbuu ya bilimi na bilimi kutso pimisi dia mvibuu.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Ni mundaa bo, Enoki, kaa a bisi wa mu isieende kia tsaamba nha mbisi a Aadami, abili mbii bu: «Diyuu! Pfumu sa ayiri na mafuundu na mafuundu ma batumu ba ngira, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />mu ufuundusu baata boosi. Ee, Nziaambi sa asieembe ba ngaa masumu boosi, mundaa biyiluu bibibi bia idiingi kwa bo kioosi. Nde sa asieembe bo mu bituyi bioosi, bi baata bahele na likiinzi, bapaliia mu nde.» <verse eid="JUD 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Baata ba koo kinyi pe, na bali mu ubaayene ayaya mutaanga dioosi. Bo bubaaduku manzala ma bo mamabi. Bali na liwaa, na bubaasoo baata mu nzala ya ubaa.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mandoongi na pamisi kwaa libuundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Banduu ba me ba litoono, mundaa yatala beni, dilibili moonyi mu mandaa ma batumu ba Yiisu Kristo Pfumu a bisi, bakwiyaabisa beni. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Bo baleeli kwaa beni: «Mu biluumbu bia tsieelele, sa uba na baata bakaasa beni na Nziaambi saa. Bo sa badiaata weti buli manzala ma bo mamabi, mamali mu utakila bo na Nziaambi.» <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Dimono bo, babali mu ubee kabini! Bo baluulu mu matsimi ma imuutu, na Muheebili a Nziaambi a ali mu bo pe.<verse eid="JUD 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Ka beni, banduu ba me ba litoono, dihama mu utuungu idiingi kia beni nha yulu a ibwa kia imiini kiavulu bungira. Dikuundu Nziaambi mu litu la Muheebili wa Ngira. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Dihama mu litoono la Nziaambi, na disa ilimbisi kia beni mu kolokolo a Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo, paa dibaa moonyi wa bilimi na bilimi.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Diba na ngebe dia babali na makengi ma usa imiini. <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Beni utuu uvuusu baata bana mu upalisa bo kutso mbaa. Kwaa baba mosi, dikwiilili bo ka ngebe, ka ku tso boomo, a dibumunu so bikutu bia bo pe, biasumuu mu imuutu kia bo.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Buzitu kwaa Nziaambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Dibilani Nziaambi wuli na litu la ukebe beni, paa beni dinyaala ubwa mu masumu. Nde sa wadisa baata bahele a tsieembili, na sa abiti beni nha kulu a buzitu ba nde mu kinyi yalaa. <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />Dibilani Nziaambi, ndila nde li Nziaambi. Ni nde ayobili bisi bu atsinduu Pfumu a bisi Yiisu Kristo. Nyaala buzitu, lituu, bunene na litumu biba kwaa nde, mu taanga dioosi, mu taanga di, na mu bilimi na bilimi! Ameni.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>